    <node id="&quot;BEEKEEPING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Beekeeping is an activity that connects humans with the natural world."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the craft and business of managing honey bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the craft and industry of maintaining honey bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the craft and industry of managing honey bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the industry and practice of managing bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the industry and practice of managing honey bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the industry and practice of managing honeybee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the industry in which John Miller operates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the industry of managing bee colonies for honey and pollination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the industry of managing bees for honey and wax."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the industry of managing bees for honey production."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the industry or practice of maintaining bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the occupation of managing bee colonies for honey and pollination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the practice and industry of maintaining bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the practice of maintaining and caring for honey bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the practice of maintaining and managing bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the practice of maintaining bee colonies for honey and pollination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the practice of maintaining bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the practice of managing bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the practice of managing bees for products like honey and wax."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the practice of managing honey bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the practice of managing honey bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the practice of managing honeybee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the profession of managing bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping is the professional practice of managing bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeeping was historically a cottage industry and a sideline in America."&lt;SEP&gt;"The beekeeping industry involves the practice of managing bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The craft and industry of managing honey bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The industry and practice of maintaining honey bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The practice and industry of maintaining honey bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The practice and industry of managing bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The practice of maintaining and managing honey bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The practice of maintaining honey bee colonies."</data>
