    <node id="&quot;HONEY SUPERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Boxes used to collect honey, available in various sizes like shallow and mid-depth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey supers are additional boxes added to a hive for honey storage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey supers are additional hive boxes used specifically for collecting honey."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey supers are boxes of frames used to collect honey from bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey supers are boxes used by beekeepers to collect honey."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey supers are boxes used by bees to store excess honey."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey supers are boxes used by bees to store honey."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey supers are parts of a hive used to collect surplus honey."</data>
