    <node id="&quot;SMOKER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A device used to calm bees during hive inspections."&lt;SEP&gt;"A smoker is a device used to calm bees during installation or work."&lt;SEP&gt;"A smoker is a piece of beekeeping equipment used to calm bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"A smoker is a piece of equipment used by beekeepers."&lt;SEP&gt;"A smoker is a tool used by beekeepers to aid in hive management."&lt;SEP&gt;"A smoker is a tool used by beekeepers to calm bees during hive inspections."&lt;SEP&gt;"A smoker is a tool used by beekeepers to calm bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"A smoker is a tool used by beekeepers to mask alarm pheromones and distract bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"A smoker is a tool used to calm bees during hive inspections."&lt;SEP&gt;"A smoker is used to blow smoke into the hive to calm the bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used by beekeepers to calm bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used by beekeepers to produce smoke to calm and direct bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"An essential beekeeping tool that uses smoke to calm bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"The smoker is a device used to produce smoke for beekeeping."&lt;SEP&gt;"The smoker is a tool used to calm bees when working in hives."</data>
