    <node id="&quot;HIVE TOOL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A hive tool is a metal implement used by beekeepers to manipulate hive components."&lt;SEP&gt;"A hive tool is a piece of equipment used for manipulating hives."&lt;SEP&gt;"A hive tool is a piece of equipment used for scraping wax and prying hive components."&lt;SEP&gt;"A hive tool is a steel implement used by beekeepers to open hives."&lt;SEP&gt;"A hive tool is used to pry up corners of the hive super."&lt;SEP&gt;"A hive tool is used to separate and slide frames apart."&lt;SEP&gt;"A metal tool used for manipulating parts of a hive."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used as a lever to manipulate frames and remove propolis."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used by beekeepers for manipulating hive components."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used by beekeepers to pry open hive components."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used by beekeepers to scrape and manipulate hive components."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used for manipulating beehives."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used to dislodge propolis from hive openings."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used to pry hive sections apart and remove frames."&lt;SEP&gt;"The hive tool is a basic necessity used in beekeeping."</data>
