    <node id="&quot;FOUNDATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Foundation is a material used by beekeepers to provide a starting point for bees to build comb."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foundation is a material used in hives to help bees draw out comb."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foundation is a sheet used by bees as a base to build honeycomb."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foundation is a thin sheet of wax or plastic with embossed hexagonal cells."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foundation is the base material that bees use to build comb."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foundation is the base provided for bees to build their combs upon."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foundation is the base upon which bees build their wax comb."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foundation is the base used by bees to build wax combs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foundation is the base within frames that bees use to build comb."&lt;SEP&gt;"The base material upon which bees build their wax combs."</data>
