    <node id="&quot;SUSTAINABLE AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A university-published newsletter about sustainable agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture involves applying resources to develop technology and social institutions for farming."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is a broad farming approach focused on success and sustainability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is a farming approach aimed at changing the world through sustainability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is a farming approach focused on ecological balance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is a farming method focused on environmental health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is a field of practice focused on maintaining system integrity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is a focus of discussion regarding environmental and social standards."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is a management tool based on diversification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is a method of farming based on the discovery of how farm elements interact."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is a method of farming focused on long-term environmental health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is a network of organic and regional producers focused on sustainability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is a practical domain where philosophy and sustainability intersect."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is a site-specific farming industry approach."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is a site-specific, whole-farm approach aimed at reducing costs and increasing efficiency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is an alternative approach to farming viewed as a modern form of agrarianism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is an economically viable and environmentally sound system of agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is an ongoing process of discovery and farming practice."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable agriculture is the field of study and practice taught by faculty."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6efabe1598e6b04e35168d3c337aa67b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3561dc31683327d8a6cc82dd5ad8b2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b73ca7de046e79c23f93a20f80755db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99e4abb0de7b0941ca1fc87ecc8fb4fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0df07cda5b04335cf0c778b648161319&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12c1e39a2b39311bfd6f1c3c05dab313&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b6ff8589dcaca5214d3db25104a4fc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1791122186a3d77110cdc1caf21599f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416c88a4653bbd08275b4ad4b3f6d0d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38d2ea190331fa57b51edf78d0352738&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c283b7bbdc3724574b4a465b7e4d29c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65953ac0df3c024d00056d147d289531&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3099841c9e59bebef5ddbb5acdb1e41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f4e1bfb463bad4d66c64f0be72baf51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d23622a472c2e4d3c363267d1723d003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9a4c4a87611b19fd1b27e7ae81974b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66bbc17b9fd4fb132a3a76abd2df0690&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17984d082222b7d2f1526b0b77119804&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef577d840302c2f3d95d7cb5a8f77433&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0a5052e04a7b64a097459ad1bd8a957</data>
