      <data key="d1">"A country where truffle orchards are well established."&lt;SEP&gt;"A country where various grazing experiments and meetings took place."&lt;SEP&gt;"A country whose postrevolutionary state was a subject of geopolitical debate."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is a country mentioned in relation to vine growing."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is a country mentioned in the context of grass growth variations."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is a country that banned certain neonicotinoids in 1999."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is a country where descriptions of pasture rotation were supplied in the eighteenth century."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is a country where dry meadow grass is found in the centre."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is a country where mycorrhizal association has been observed on potatoes in hilly regions."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is a country where queen bees are shipped."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is a country where rationed grazing trials were observed."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the country where Jefferson served as ambassador."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the country where Seine-Maritime and Meurthe-et-Moselle are located."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the country where Voisin worked with cattle."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the country where the Warré hive was developed."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the country where the author encountered cases of rationed grazing."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the country where the author studied vine cultivation."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the country where the dry meadow grass system is practiced in the centre."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the country where the minister of Agriculture is from."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the country where the minister serves and meetings were held."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the country where the racing stables consuming La Crau hay are located."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the location of an international conference where the Talloires Declaration was developed."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the location where vines are treated with copper compounds to fight mildew."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is where early indoor mushroom g