      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A specific system of grazing advocated by the author."&lt;SEP&gt;"A systematic method of managing pasture and livestock grazing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rational grazing is a management technique used to improve grass utilization and stocking rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rational grazing is a method developed by Voisin for managing livestock."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rational grazing is a method of livestock management developed by Voisin."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rational grazing is a system of grassland management synonymous with good grazing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rational grazing is a system of livestock management focused on optimized pasture use."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rational grazing is a system of pasture management designed to satisfy the requirements of both grass and animals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rational grazing is a systematic method of livestock management and pasture division."</data>
