    <node id="&quot;CCD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A phenomenon associated with the disappearance of worker bees from the hive."&lt;SEP&gt;"CCD is a phenomenon causing bee loss and increasing demand for queen-rearers."&lt;SEP&gt;"CCD is a phenomenon involving the disappearance of bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"CCD is a phenomenon of hive losses that first appeared in 2006."&lt;SEP&gt;"CCD is an abbreviation for Colony Collapse Disorder."&lt;SEP&gt;"CCD is an abbreviation for colony collapse disorder."&lt;SEP&gt;"CCD refers to Colony Collapse Disorder affecting bee hives."&lt;SEP&gt;"CCD refers to Colony Collapse Disorder affecting bee populations."&lt;SEP&gt;"CCD refers to Colony Collapse Disorder deaths."&lt;SEP&gt;"CCD refers to Colony Collapse Disorder in bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"CCD refers to Colony Collapse Disorder."&lt;SEP&gt;"CCD refers to colony collapse disorder affecting honey bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"CCD refers to colony collapse disorder losses in honey bee populations."&lt;SEP&gt;"CCD, or Colony Collapse Disorder, is a disorder affecting honey bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"CCD, or Colony Collapse Disorder, is a phenomenon involving the death of bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"CCD, or Colony Collapse Disorder, is the phenomenon of honey bee colony collapses."&lt;SEP&gt;"CCD, or Colony Collapse Disorder, refers to mass die-offs of bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Colony Collapse Disorder affecting bee populations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Colony Collapse Disorder affecting honey bee populations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Colony Collapse Disorder investigations into bee health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Colony Collapse Disorder is a disorder characterized by the mass disappearance of honey bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Colony Collapse Disorder is a phenomenon affecting bee populations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Colony Collapse Disorder, a phenomenon the genome group is researching."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3ad59b3ec786d96ceb0cf84e4d5b8446&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08ecb691c2f9f13d9852979644924e78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba112c4310be31fc99e92db5c7bc7f59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3b8b4459ac7b875e2ed855774601f4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-412bb4d9e4870a3cb542b0d1793d0568&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f0965a7f888753898bdb3624830c9fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77dbdef00cf07d39bd84f0bbdd0936be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-936929886afd4a64ba379fe6ac052a32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-073fb9290edc2d9768894a26e7788ead&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d268b118d865a964f0911adbcd24b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50d84e8388b1b3835cf15d2729a7bded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6c384530d2705c862df0ec1ef11c2d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52fd5c92980e8846f221b5900200a76f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6deba29b237640ada67472e874a1f037&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-280e4eba2d5b92ebc5f548d23b3591b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-caa3c81818171fc49da384672e628346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a697f407a502a7dd40f46f29b9540dbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b56d1daf41a7135af792e5f17f10061&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dce07dbfe1cb37dbe56f8651f3f0f484&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-880657fcead983c1ada31e3024872a79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53dab54c5e432f26775d35bbbc12efa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24285ce060eba50dee0f1aeb98d3fb26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de87ea9ee6a2918a9d0691e22c69a3bf</data>
