    <node id="&quot;SIR ALBERT HOWARD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An expert who wrote about fertile soil and humus."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual who referred to dumps as humus mines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard designed diamond cities and prophesied the folly of water-based sewage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard developed composting practices and the Law of Return."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard developed the Indore Process for converting waste into compost."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard developed the Indore Process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard invited the author to write the appendix."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard is a central figure and author whose work on India and agriculture is cited."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard is a person who discussed the virtue of compost."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard is a person who envisioned the cultivation of the highlands of the chalk country."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard is an author of works on organic agriculture who cited King's book."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard is an individual focused on improving soil and plant food quality."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard is known as the godfather of scientific aerobic composting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard is the advocate of the Indore method of humus production."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard is the author and practitioner who emphasized health as the one great subject."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard is the author of An Agricultural Testament."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard is the individual who proposed the Law of Return."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard is the person who advocated the Indore method of composting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard provided insights on the role of compost as an inoculant."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard was a figure who understood the role of soil life in fertility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard was a government scientist and author who advocated for organic agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard wrote about the relationship between soil health and human health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sir Albert Howard wrote the pamphlet on the manufacture of humus."</data>
