    <node id="&quot;INDORE PROCESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Indore Process is a composting method spreading in temperate countries."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Indore Process is a method for creating compost in agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Indore Process is a method for manufacturing humus to improve soil fertility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Indore Process is a method of composting successful in various climates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Indore Process is a method of composting used in agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Indore Process is a method of composting used to improve tea yield and quality."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Indore Process is a method of composting."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Indore Process is a method of converting animal and vegetable wastes into compost."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Indore Process is a method of converting vegetable and animal wastes into humus."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Indore Process is a method of converting wastes into compost or humus."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Indore Process is a method of making compost."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Indore Process is a method used to convert wastes into humus."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Indore Process is a system of composting involving the collection and admixture of vegetable and animal wastes."</data>
