    <node id="&quot;NORTH AMERICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">North America is a continent and geographic region encompassing Canada and the United States. It is characterized by diverse mushroom species, extensive beekeeping practices, and a history of agricultural development and soil management.</data>
