    <node id="&quot;EUROPE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">Europe is a continent with diverse agricultural histories, including manorial systems, mixed husbandry, and a commercial mushroom industry. It is a major market for North American exports and is characterized by its specific climates, biodiversity trends, and beekeeping practices.</data>
