    <node id="&quot;AFRICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">Africa is a continent characterized by diverse agriculture, ranging from subsistence slash-and-burn and no-till farming to wildlife management and honey bee migration. The region faces soil erosion and food security challenges, though it is also noted for its native species and specific food delicacies.</data>
