    <node id="&quot;UNITED STATES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">The United States is a North American country characterized by a diverse agricultural landscape, ranging from industrial farming and federal subsidies to growing interests in sustainable practices and local food movements. It is a significant hub for honey bee and mushroom cultivation, though it faces challenges with agricultural pests, diseases, and soil degradation.</data>
