    <node id="&quot;AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">Agriculture is the science, industry, and practice of farming, cultivating soil, and raising livestock to produce food and fiber. It is discussed as a fundamental global industry central to food security, ecosystem management, and sustainability.</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97671f3accd940ff737ed73cb3f15486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-553c0f788a5df6c23a481c0a3efdaabb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c089588623c308c216371ab7fa2700d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a35a75b0bc3a557b68f4dc4d5219ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-993680272f3e5678f61ebce7fc3d0706&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eb662dfdbe902c6b759c1dcd149c71a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a53016a697e0effe105f2db336bea3b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05374d444d89278cd804bde3807b7797&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59f100ffb03d2213b475479279d60e37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8643f291873d6f95495391decd99ef7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-606bb2ef5a69bfd9d5624ad8d5f3f93d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ffffbaa4bb43bbfd0d35d31576ac37d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-473f8348a15ba74f2e21ca4cc96c583e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b547b6cef0753ad76c2ec6637caea67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1609048eb7cbdd2e53212288aa2d0e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-550966fca0f2f090187553fe9bc99e80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-571b3fa101d4bb8e213e6691eda956ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6acd1bd95566acfb8cf6c422a4a4f7b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6c384530d2705c862df0ec1ef11c2d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46ddfffa0309c4f9eea8332588a12855&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c58f4785be38b80316bcdb547edbe48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a496eb9c6c8d4c66c22b3ac65fe5b31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ba9b55dcb2de76a73fed895734246f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31a758dd964014cee9e676552e737a61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-380a03b915a35f23558c861103a74ff7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e410bfae74fb6896e8e0079e060cf83d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbb61501e645127f9021b6ed20f37476&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04b17869172fff33b1c7bc2284173657&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d63fd363bb5b8e772c6c0e59279b321&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b8e1c006d239029795854fde00ebba1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b332155c310163f415407daadd055a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03f80535289583d0b174a792dec934f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd6cef65b73cbf090d0f46d890908a11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ca4f0fa36ad8d06c0f3a5233524fac7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8d3828434db854107ffe391485c26e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ef01b6c92c978eb990b4b99dc85a664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70b90cdc95e55e4bab77a6fde3ec1343&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbfeb7e87aab57b5e1710b2ca71c0a2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a2b149109bafd5b0ae7c5375006ab5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-736ea6711636125c220e214941062b61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c