    <node id="&quot;CALIFORNIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">California is a populous U.S. state and major agricultural hub that produces over 70 percent of the world's almond crop. It is a key location for beekeeping operations, organic farming, and the shipping of produce.</data>
