    <node id="&quot;NEW ZEALAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">New Zealand is a country where the author gave speeches and various agricultural research on grazing, soil health, and composting was conducted. It is home to the Ruakura Animal Research Station and the Humic Compost Club.</data>
