    <node id="&quot;VIRGINIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">Virginia is a U.S. state in the southern Appalachian mountains region. It is the location of numerous agricultural entities, including Polyface Farm, Lynchburg Grows, and Appalachian Sustainable Development.</data>
