    <node id="&quot;VERMONT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">Vermont is a U.S. state with a northern climate, featuring the Green Mountains and Champlain Valley. It is the location of Middlebury College, the Intervale Center Farm Incubator, and the author's beekeeping operations.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1b96aee8fce1383e3a88948dc5d0aad4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a5cfe3323511c9b97faca58e44619a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e4ee41b73c052db0b90b67ae962bc28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b464827b98fd832772a9e2806f166940&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80cb5b40207cce260add50ac65980ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f970a1d154acdb2ae156eac6a317018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f30f69a81886f658de51b870faedd598&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-485a6a1d47c4c9bf2bf563c9e11d4af9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f0965a7f888753898bdb3624830c9fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abf15980aea2d79d85e102a8e8c947bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-931d0f7479e9dd63e66694c8dd0f68bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6696f8ef99d58e5e15f540cf5edf86a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1e6b92e2d699a91a2124de7f67662fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbfbbce7bbb2b1195a5322a8057953dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bd6606d64af56a1c2f7c398c12f78f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb33ca6e0dec58803e47a21bf100c03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80590371c3ba416132df035a1f48358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-622c003f3eb63c8fc5cb7dc192c0e76d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea68cfbbe3fc012d7e18af95936eb15e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d4150698732f393c235b8b3e1cb2d88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58c9172daf9801bd62c5822cc8c36ab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cee44e954d1abb009f061fd993b844c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-955ad3356ae65234e36469cc7de4b3e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e962d9ff8064282a92c3166d68acbc0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfd05a12ef78763e74306325feeb5eac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-086256446757da0fffa536b4247d998d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6287c81b3be930766b61c0ad32bf562f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fda7a4926edf81f63ac6018a79d56da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb725f31999b5452e1ba0388600c6589&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f1544f96bf3906c3ffd91d3f551a278&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22f0ad20db2374dde44294c481f26b21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-875244dbf5b92a0cbabb5deff3c5629e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1de5be48f8b86dabc08e5087f75750aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-141bd4f59be1ccee796abafaf0658f22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36349dc9e2604b53b31c0c3d9931128e</data>
