    <node id="&quot;MILLER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">Miller is a commercial migratory beekeeper and business owner who manages thousands of hives for honey production and almond pollination. He is an experienced researcher and author who has documented bee losses, varroa mite infestations, and colony collapse.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0702b35ab5da980ccafcd8b491aa1562&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-911d39a734ce63729ca31ddecfbbdb10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec1f94cc5f14959e322093167c5b5ac2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc6b42805d670ff5f1b75194ea815c5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dd6250bf9119073ff90517ec6a09534&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00f2377f0cd08c77c000df20f4ac40c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1bab4a72f46eead5c78b6d5b292d2ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8422f27b6e2f7c49af2d7c0895af1179&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-464158e8ae6f11d3eade0bd5a72fca55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13d75b31628c95bce2d1de33c7d05683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-688342abe8464e36fad009bdc5a7a22f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-912655071bfb31832bd5d960fea37c88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-936929886afd4a64ba379fe6ac052a32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5711a5f5dfd11e4a830061fafb1909d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75673023cb192cee1fbe66473e0ff86d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47bc4d6bb9b54f7a4498039a09e27192&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5886c64a8eabfd9136afefc941f06b85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50d84e8388b1b3835cf15d2729a7bded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dac5e0fc4b3efb7d62d286bfe82fe84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12ca6ad40e2f56cfc0ab67f96d1552b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1b198fa71b44d8dd33dcfc2eb267be7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67da272e0cf77b7a72954b23074375bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-280e4eba2d5b92ebc5f548d23b3591b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dff8f6d16d91f6c080ca2e3b7cb50555&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55b59d57778c2109af21150bee2b7208&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6595de7e08679e25db37588321f5c89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb6afb7b86fd8dee5d1ffc49066a3be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64b1d9cb4feb594eafc5f44559345e22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0984220078ce71973ba3b0fa10b37a2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e3bb2a40d743661733d6555e921ace&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8e6144bc70a4f4cbdf43cfe854a269e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7acff18895bfa08e6388fc660689bad7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-944c5b4df7883966aee796898bc6c38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67d5af1111b2fbb8c1cd36ed46e7709b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d8286e6a8f25ded00034a7a287f09cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9eafb5519ae847ebc95f1b6bd7a3901&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afb886065fde7376bc6f30e23079e875&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85eaeec0849996dd41a39cefe3eb69e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dce07dbfe1cb37dbe56f8651f3f0f484&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82d288912e79b43bbf8f55e37e96c89c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53dab54c5e43