    <node id="&quot;JEFFERSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">Jefferson was a political leader, author of the Declaration of Independence, and patron of agrarian philosophy who linked farming to citizenship and virtue. He is a historical figure associated with Monticello, the Louisiana Purchase, and the promotion of sustainability and community-oriented ethics.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-72ac4184da0b36e65982eb7c72e1e025&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98c0d05f4a0ed6c440d52fd2f060cf55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89231dc9df6367dfeaa7e74d7dd3e375&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5add464238772f14d15e0e73bc4ad2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c613cbad49e71f1cd416e26e34150f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84729b070482e322c7c832ced520e10b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4953d5aa366add6d40468e1643931eaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff197400ac8e94cfb08419bd8a6c660a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff7ff846be03f8677673730625ad6e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a496eb9c6c8d4c66c22b3ac65fe5b31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44b869f980d6664b6e8d9930d9e12a16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a488dc13c8287677db8f5b116ebb1a1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b08c5812a78d79a773ecd56c3c1e084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e3da01f719a88fbedfd67f21916a1c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbb61501e645127f9021b6ed20f37476&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4b97dd6d6b95eae2e9e3d26bad764c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4225696c39528f2ce0e21784032e94f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa6c175f37ce7089fa657f33595c666c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ebf23631547617747b7c2b24e2249cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a9921cf42c52cb58653d22cae4ded08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00790ac56a654c0cfb0da5632ad72e10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd6cef65b73cbf090d0f46d890908a11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dbc1c2ec064a792c47e97c74d0a8614&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8d3828434db854107ffe391485c26e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8adcb8e80a538f06909fb931e2ebec15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4cb059595fad783966d73f011af493a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd1c1d4f15102d0ce3bf4f9a157c71f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3330698527e14dc575dc6a2e0e2a7c9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e7bc5a59a0a74b310624922fb53f5b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e15cd11d4bfedd81ebb62a5bb18b7913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21251d93da08e46a2457c1d8ac3cc530&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d86b4a55af4fdaec0c4c33982e78baf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb807e6a60ab003ee9b4b47c9c83c846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d5818cdf2378e6f878f29ebbca00962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf669185fd520e9a112a6a92f50cf468</data>
