    <node id="&quot;INDIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">India is a country with diverse agricultural production, including cotton, tea, and sugar, where researchers like Sir Albert Howard conducted extensive botanical and soil studies. It is characterized by a mix of traditional knowledge, modern irrigation challenges, and a superabundant agricultural labor force.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e39371de713a69cf0046c780cff853ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3aa67e460572c5b411d4fcd2e4ec545&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac5c0d8327eb6e62733fe07d24f28c17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-363259c41f29f455370656b3d04be170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2be6b9145cdce9275f8166f477a4339b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbe735eff1ddb5f51823657c9cb6e03f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afd82d44193e10128839b8f9cf5d0309&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5181a113eeffb24e1b85b75fd426e595&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a84e08e72dbcede617b9bd7325656657&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2cfa5d47951922b9548793616a7b5e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1308290a383b7cf6cad5084748151135&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68ecb1aa0348f63fc34ba2697d905e2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-635531b84bb4fbfde1eef86a36c0896a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1f7e3ba7786fba28e5d662f74af986c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdf1164d3ae68bc11bfb68aafa3662ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88b98e2001c5ae7faad90b16ac45f0cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5332439349dbc980b17ca1f0c9044b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d77164fb123ff92d554d3e1bc99f7301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3781f0cc9a2995419d1d77092b5b7e7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57b11ced128b01bd1e4592b2aede7c0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49e54f756180fea1648a4f8a1c56a989&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-165ffa99d9b25c0de4c3507c99c92965&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2bc97c834d9d98155900a4731b802d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-187f47c8b8e6814f319c165475064ae6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3ec7042824affce861cdabd50e020f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a81a83856d7b7ec39448bc80f43b8fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bdb0f411423ef25bbe468e5f7b202ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c29c0579cd80e1a7dbd0b335ca85272&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-162427b12ed8d1e50c5d8b055e2cd5f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48779ccefd65e29504648e87fe948afa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9be35452a55159cea361655ca53487b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65edb41384e08b49b56188bbf153099d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-428e9d4590233f76ed9b454b23423b71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-145b265b8d53df8f70babd69fc84ec3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf82877961e08200011936c26d80e1bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03f80535289583d0b174a792dec934f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28ab0744bd2c8644bdc99e6c30ae80a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1932cb031e5713bde84668b6254f5c5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3919d4c03198902b92f0ca8b3c52a40c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f820b4fd30fc97f0083ef9327fa9ac7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93fd8b3490e04