    <node id="&quot;CHINA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">China is a major global producer and exporter of honey, phosphorus, and various mushrooms, including Shiitake and Ling Chi. The country is characterized by intensive agriculture, a long history of mushroom cultivation techniques, and significant trade in almonds and organic apples.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-74cd72bbc78235ee2cc27e78214fb076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25cec84d3faefdd8e04042d49203e0e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de4b66d69047666bdb2ab47a03828fc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb648e07d9441fbfe3bcee4498fbad8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d1aec09332ff6a142a5567b1afdc379&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-363259c41f29f455370656b3d04be170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22f3967d311f087b86fc91bd0708142c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd4b544ed75741294a829a0b07b3bdf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba34a2616df408aea43de3a851323499&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c412d7b08105fd05e24e46b46f204fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f716dbb539b9e685559a05a8f9f5d54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41976a69de893e06188aa8717a3c4235&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8422f27b6e2f7c49af2d7c0895af1179&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76eba1d230844cb33e45b56b8cfd620d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc84578a2a9965cca7bdee803ba8f735&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b994c4aaecb06bda273f0e09161deddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64c2af8229ae517acd685a5341a4b3ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d488e4cd2bbc4b091273904e594e2cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-422fbd40d9eaa3fb837b775984c912c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6d1c5c9d85a28b024fb5b126803180d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ad03c75085e62d4cf641ff00f56a870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3e7055c35d73ed38d71048f4698efe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bece2f190b302e65065ab1536812a7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-187f47c8b8e6814f319c165475064ae6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e3d2608ec774e94ae3556c5b7d8cd1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52fd5c92980e8846f221b5900200a76f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67da272e0cf77b7a72954b23074375bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35b441cca050d846fb6c051fc61db257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82bc20afcc996297375967f9d759b0ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-162427b12ed8d1e50c5d8b055e2cd5f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65176548bde10cfe17c293a533bace23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86fe558f51b1271d8f00b8534ee37050&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65edb41384e08b49b56188bbf153099d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ab2196ed3cfc357ea2968eacf70e5cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d469c3c1cca95791a7f4b297e0182d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b8363ae68571ed2f72d039837e5d11c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87fba51a43132c1fcb0a51e42da41fb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fe8a4b8462310a0c1d2d68cbd07f35b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d467caefee31df754438e71491848a84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e04f10386c4a39e5f50574580ea2171d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d6710a74adf9