    <node id="&quot;JOHN MILLER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">John Miller is a multi-generational commercial beekeeper operating in California and North Dakota, known as an innovator and partner in Honey Stinger. He is a board member of Project Apis mellifera and a subject of the author's book.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7838234dc3bb876ced6fabea41222695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f71ef08ac19996ce0f766b5703b86c3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08ecb691c2f9f13d9852979644924e78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc6b42805d670ff5f1b75194ea815c5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e823f4271cc674d258a850b82bd8b70b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c9fa8be9c480f16c9786fe42c4a409a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-001b3ca70f42e9cc2ce8671a72009988&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1bab4a72f46eead5c78b6d5b292d2ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c835bb690f30f5b9d4fe6eae38419d9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fca26c7bdc4650cbef0a23f400c72ee8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-073fb9290edc2d9768894a26e7788ead&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b6278bcba2e2dfe6f1202b147f87019&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d268b118d865a964f0911adbcd24b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88b98e2001c5ae7faad90b16ac45f0cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-855fe967816e81fd83bf1374e0f99957&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52fd5c92980e8846f221b5900200a76f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6deba29b237640ada67472e874a1f037&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9961d83fcb353d87b0c300b9b3408c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27c4a101237a6eb4eff648c0b0b5a16d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64b1d9cb4feb594eafc5f44559345e22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0984220078ce71973ba3b0fa10b37a2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-caa3c81818171fc49da384672e628346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f025d035915467517ca424f6e1fea96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7acff18895bfa08e6388fc660689bad7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67d5af1111b2fbb8c1cd36ed46e7709b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e97945a272b68a7aa63d93a54b8c6ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-708bae7fc6ca7f9031d5fe8940db78f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19b4571fdea2316371681c34c7f3af2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6a3d7885d5c7d0196e5f8b1d626686d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d1ac0226ffbeb324c79f5ab03c524d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dce07dbfe1cb37dbe56f8651f3f0f484&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cd73657f68ecf71018d63e394162ae2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa20c48947aea0538518c8462c9c2696&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e60a1dc7299568504eb57c9d8e4201b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80e647f4fae9bf23b96a7c260839df22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de87ea9ee6a2918a9d0691e22c69a3bf</data>
