    <node id="&quot;NORTH DAKOTA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">North Dakota is a U.S. state in central North America characterized by a farming industry and prime commercial beekeeping territory. It is the location of Gabe Brown's farm, Menoken Farm, and the home of John Miller's honey operations.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5780ec82bf5f9eace3f594f7e7368b9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faafe8310294120e238fe933148dfbad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dda09812f219e231d083bae5447467aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc6b42805d670ff5f1b75194ea815c5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0455c588ed816ff0b5f445247e46aade&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dd6250bf9119073ff90517ec6a09534&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bfda3cdec46f8ab5a386ecf15ae6edb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21be92c21b7215c9e86b338cd15d5f1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f20e140e1c799a2e1a35a7c9720b9c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47bc4d6bb9b54f7a4498039a09e27192&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d268b118d865a964f0911adbcd24b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1791122186a3d77110cdc1caf21599f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50d84e8388b1b3835cf15d2729a7bded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12ca6ad40e2f56cfc0ab67f96d1552b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52fd5c92980e8846f221b5900200a76f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6deba29b237640ada67472e874a1f037&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dff8f6d16d91f6c080ca2e3b7cb50555&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9961d83fcb353d87b0c300b9b3408c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-253af24cc5cc2d7d952a8f5e4a183029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb6afb7b86fd8dee5d1ffc49066a3be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64b1d9cb4feb594eafc5f44559345e22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c4b89fc508843db93c9d0cde5f230d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0984220078ce71973ba3b0fa10b37a2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e3bb2a40d743661733d6555e921ace&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7acff18895bfa08e6388fc660689bad7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e97945a272b68a7aa63d93a54b8c6ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-708bae7fc6ca7f9031d5fe8940db78f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d8286e6a8f25ded00034a7a287f09cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6a3d7885d5c7d0196e5f8b1d626686d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85eaeec0849996dd41a39cefe3eb69e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2f9bf7db953b160f0ff4e9bdf3bd0c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edf21622f766ab205d57f7915f9105bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-875244dbf5b92a0cbabb5deff3c5629e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ab2196ed3cfc357ea2968eacf70e5cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13a019e529b263129037d3a41686a1bf</data>
