    <node id="&quot;JAPAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">Japan is a country with a highly advanced mushroom cultivation industry, specializing in species such as Shiitake, Nameko, and Maitake using innovative techniques like pressurized liquid spawn and bottle culture. It is a hub for forestry and mycological research, housing institutions like the Mori Mushroom Institute and the Nara Experiment Station.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-74cd72bbc78235ee2cc27e78214fb076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a1f902ab89dda85e8440e5325809943&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95332b7697dfb1af6da09a5f6e7abd16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1569a67f674101fc6ab46edc7442941&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f7009920cf127d7bc131b6a3452479d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d1aec09332ff6a142a5567b1afdc379&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb648e07d9441fbfe3bcee4498fbad8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd4b544ed75741294a829a0b07b3bdf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2960646489fe8d44fd3e37c8e77f3ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04c7decd932543d02d71519d2eca78a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c412d7b08105fd05e24e46b46f204fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5d6d051705a68de142e311b176db586&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f716dbb539b9e685559a05a8f9f5d54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aa9e3a4728dc666c9af9ca8874591f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26840155673e52eb4a69e8dc2ae438ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49fe442094e7ea7c8e57a86dad17be24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77998f10068e98f374d36ce3925f2d80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64c2af8229ae517acd685a5341a4b3ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fc5200861bfbf924cb02074bbc681c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ad03c75085e62d4cf641ff00f56a870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-459d56574946408e6141e4469fce4745&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30828eab432a849dd4130e8fbdeae05c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064729886f339ac8895e2f324d6dd47e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aea472dfebfe03f6968437bd2ffedd3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23851b7159c8512ddbf430fa390754ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a81048c3992199bcae645ffac7f60bd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-073e90e5615dba6d80d03e475296b301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01c91bc35d36c8498b9d61a9d491bf15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-428e9d4590233f76ed9b454b23423b71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b8363ae68571ed2f72d039837e5d11c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325ed807d0495545fb84448a9a8a5863&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a64f9f1d0ae53b516c4de411cdfbaec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d467caefee31df754438e71491848a84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a71e41b29032039b5308b1f942743bd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d79cc325ae91205a578658535a12a8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d6710a74adf9d60f7c9121567c01098&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e04f10386c4a39e5f50574580ea2171d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-077fcef808696d146333d2852202d41a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d27cfb98328aecc257da5d03f30c58f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9deb5ea8a46288d76a6c05c601c4ab09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5481127c0529