    <node id="&quot;OYSTER MUSHROOMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">Oyster mushrooms are edible, gilled fungi from the genus *Pleurotus* that are cultivated on various substrates like straw and logs. They are primary decomposer species used for food and bioremediation, though they have a short shelf life.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b7bfa69d0c84a828640655a9e1bb6d1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79e103a0bcbb4b6ddbb55739f96ed492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c4d46d3440cdc793b9167edb68afcb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-211c569c81413a8e44e71f6820eda797&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d9358e0c04b5f20ecd823fd8b55df7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f4cc27ce4680927f691a69bcfefb4b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4d8ffd59b496178c8be531ac64f1a01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e49dc22c5a2b0dc1af7b81f3d504b45f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-422fbd40d9eaa3fb837b775984c912c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc6f2bfb47ab5f2e3f74b6e3971de23d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4be6e62e9f709cb21a7f4bc14f814a83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b04e4252beb8b5fe756d225bcc2e8f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69e12830990f7ea8d716253d971a2d83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa1982e0d0860562ed798939edb2f2b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-073e90e5615dba6d80d03e475296b301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86fe558f51b1271d8f00b8534ee37050&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d220bf4ad405ab55e0b72fb45eca6b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbf4d7e7600e83223b3cb9fc4c7377fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d79cc325ae91205a578658535a12a8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6330161a153f9e93f9660be64aa2f949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1634ffc0bb5eabb2ca88a56400372467&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94b7579b911838ad215d22e4a1af54d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ac9c5eed9d523ae65975634b2284ac8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfc2a2ad2b38fdda540087364d1c8ae3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccb37e0cdb4a8da2abeb8e6f9a8e1962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee67735ee2d22fc01623c11e43940a78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9231a797b87527809ee6f102a188204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c0c3389beaed103f9b9d331d49fd8c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd38f5dfd7f143e7367f577fd08efd6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ca26f2f469a9af57a6edc3d86c628d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-526270b8a734dc850c078d50fae4f31c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25db8095ea0b0d4b55ab42331903d3f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7663707174b73b4652d6d69af20a169b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c69b496654d5bdddbb3e95f39359af4e</data>
