    <node id="&quot;SHIITAKE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">Shiitake (*Lentinula edodes*) is a wood-loving, gilled mushroom species cultivated for its gourmet and medicinal properties. It is grown using various techniques, including log culture and supplemented sawdust substrates.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-aad141c0fce5386cc774eed8060381e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7bfa69d0c84a828640655a9e1bb6d1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a1f902ab89dda85e8440e5325809943&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79e103a0bcbb4b6ddbb55739f96ed492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95332b7697dfb1af6da09a5f6e7abd16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb648e07d9441fbfe3bcee4498fbad8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a232b780828815f5f3ae849be74bb78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ac66f2a993a8f84ec2280130d78e1c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26840155673e52eb4a69e8dc2ae438ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46e9e0130e03680a43c0613b80bd5b3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4d8ffd59b496178c8be531ac64f1a01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0844446be98c91a11acfc07bb4139aa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64c2af8229ae517acd685a5341a4b3ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb3712268b2112abbfd70a0198757a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4466fc05408f4d774f674142f50ffdd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-422fbd40d9eaa3fb837b775984c912c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc6f2bfb47ab5f2e3f74b6e3971de23d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae75bc4ed78b7d77043e56d26eeeccc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3976576526a8b6a2b5953a09a2db40f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-800e0b66b56649c0bb08b5036495f580&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35f9fc22b554f5298eee9a9d070d4441&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d305ceab31b27e4602db91f42ba2fe00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9373ee84b3a77eb37578d5b0a36a9135&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d4b92006db2e1bfffb89c800fc0a3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa1982e0d0860562ed798939edb2f2b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa277f519f741bae0953f07b1e1bbf79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23851b7159c8512ddbf430fa390754ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40e1d4c37dd2fdc2bcb1f760872f5cfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35b441cca050d846fb6c051fc61db257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-073e90e5615dba6d80d03e475296b301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a770fe44fb2da17e5fecb2bbe8fbd7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d220bf4ad405ab55e0b72fb45eca6b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6595de7e08679e25db37588321f5c89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c4109338117a5ad23b02b74d9159c88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91456f98a926e6abc80385dc245cc777&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80f3114ef1baf490cfb393829f0edd17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1c5dbb55ca53672746cb230af692bc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d79cc325ae91205a578658535a12a8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9869e53adcb9d90fe040e3a2bec26a90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eb41a6cccc4a6f5098f96d60fefa6c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6330161a153f9