    <node id="&quot;ASIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">Asia is a geographical region and continent characterized by immense plains, lakes, and subtropical regions. It has a long tradition of gourmet mushroom cultivation, honey hunting, and diverse agricultural practices, including the study of nutrient recycling and crop rotations.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-74cd72bbc78235ee2cc27e78214fb076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89313a604603d854506a3dd824a4a1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74c9c00fc19895ed849661987adee4cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e823f4271cc674d258a850b82bd8b70b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dce32ddceff9da5a8dff8d861090706&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-817bac06738b1392b1904426ad3a9798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8f4ced19f39489760889dcf78f83b4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1308290a383b7cf6cad5084748151135&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5ce6c852fdf02cfb0438bb72b575bc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1f7e3ba7786fba28e5d662f74af986c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5711a5f5dfd11e4a830061fafb1909d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-096e2f877b1d380c9b6ee623940df75d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33ea2f9846e58f5947feff6e3a84d189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ad03c75085e62d4cf641ff00f56a870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cf015c914ceeb12acc1a5f9c6773a85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00ca524316427ad52b01cb6871e49060&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-800e0b66b56649c0bb08b5036495f580&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9373ee84b3a77eb37578d5b0a36a9135&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5222544fbac611153c3910b7a49b1632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67da272e0cf77b7a72954b23074375bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dff8f6d16d91f6c080ca2e3b7cb50555&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d7b50e88ceffec311ad8345ea78ee7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da657fc11e9f746515ea884faf190105&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bf6ea422300d7cce3d594e740c6f1f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c4109338117a5ad23b02b74d9159c88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d467caefee31df754438e71491848a84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a11bfe1dc62c3ee867b5e29138914b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e69dee1c96e41bfd054cbe43266a769&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01d793c2dc61cc5608f3044cefea7d3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5753cf47228cedb4b58dfbff8318e398&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afb886065fde7376bc6f30e23079e875&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a529b2a82aeedaec884d490e181507e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d1ac0226ffbeb324c79f5ab03c524d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfc2a2ad2b38fdda540087364d1c8ae3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaf19c04e874b6deb92ca7f0145054be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b5917356402ab1051d609ddf238bd22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-503fd9df081d23d8ec7105a0dfdec72c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c69d184d39c4fc61b176c219e8852dce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54338209a610084057de4fde840e5cf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4455bd7c30235e62c66747849070cfae</data>
