    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUSTRALIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">Australia is a country and continent known for its agrarian culture, wine production, and as the only region free of the Varroa mite. It is the location of Melbourne and the University of Sydney, where permaculture was developed.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d68449f9db8a1088d8cfd218d490323d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68758adec1ce1aa5af3106fe56e7d365&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5ce19ae9aa388ea7266cc28400656a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de4b66d69047666bdb2ab47a03828fc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f11905a2957c65e69706bb6f3ff65226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-445fbff3137d26bce84d879934fb156e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6960fa545678f7ef098947fd99e7d73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1163eda64030bc6fc1ff1fe14739cca6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-001b3ca70f42e9cc2ce8671a72009988&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c6f8753099a6779fea902d00492c19f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8422f27b6e2f7c49af2d7c0895af1179&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-419e80efe9993622fcb085a34f66a623&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-096e2f877b1d380c9b6ee623940df75d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d580c7d10d48422c163979c0340d0afa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5010f12c1a9feda14321ff2156104eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16c3fe8c089550fd16987a1c4f301a2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1609048eb7cbdd2e53212288aa2d0e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7e8b4bde4465470684d8ec0af5b158a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-280e4eba2d5b92ebc5f548d23b3591b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dba83abaeb96ec65724af8f79a69606a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6c91bfa5ab36f5068604a4de8fcca42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25521141823b7becef820b71d7dbda0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb6afb7b86fd8dee5d1ffc49066a3be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-151045983723b59dfaa65a33e7a25218&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87fba51a43132c1fcb0a51e42da41fb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9f558ccef1d0a97c2f1550636dc3f28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a64f9f1d0ae53b516c4de411cdfbaec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4039c8bc6176e2b293fdf3c6952a2199&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1d159b4784f26ff000ba4dfed046754&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-782950436a4bb61b4698327ee847a64b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a11bfe1dc62c3ee867b5e29138914b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7029b183fa2cc4e652b9cb3d96c587ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c20cb47e818c53af03d9f00b71d1b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a697f407a502a7dd40f46f29b9540dbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d1ac0226ffbeb324c79f5ab03c524d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f327dcda762579e3e8ff20376026fc06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a735d5d2e5d37745145807001587dc0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a2c449f01571421e5d465367c2416a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f116a0e83303d4ebb8971bd977ade7c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ab2196ed3cfc357ea2968eacf70e5cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85284a23be3f4