    <node id="&quot;ENGLAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">England is a country characterized by its history of industrialization, utilitarian philosophy, and diverse agricultural practices, including the open-field system. It is home to locations such as Nottingham and Leicestershire, and its political and social developments historically influenced the American colonies.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c5e37349454eb3591b4615887c1807b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d68449f9db8a1088d8cfd218d490323d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-993680272f3e5678f61ebce7fc3d0706&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-591de784bfb5c3376bd8c1f7c511d0e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92e328d3b527b1888b7f5192459a3b01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84729b070482e322c7c832ced520e10b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-240dc87c75a401ddeacc3f1a641ed3ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b994c4aaecb06bda273f0e09161deddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c30aca7d7248a398bf698c2f58e21181&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fc5200861bfbf924cb02074bbc681c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85d719ed515957569d5a5c0e944e89a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12c1e39a2b39311bfd6f1c3c05dab313&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbb58cc843f6cfcf0ee4d5ba223c4dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e7fde71bc9acad15f6ba8d9629c1284&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c70a5acc631338be6403992b6cfc4d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6acd1bd95566acfb8cf6c422a4a4f7b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc063bcbb000e43f7427394a529bddaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b7877eecb47b8c4e31e1be8eeeb5ea5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc828547e31ad0722ddb6c9ae3f92d30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebd7a4883dd14c584a7c1ebf60351fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b7d1f6e890206946300a3591e785ab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03d800f99ae1e9da7a6093b276115f8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b08c5812a78d79a773ecd56c3c1e084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87aef9adbbf32f7b8ba9d9db34d927a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf76857d444c3de7b2d30bb6186a08a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7501c88b4753d0e36195cd4c777c004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4b97dd6d6b95eae2e9e3d26bad764c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a20dca5473a46eeac4310d35a490fdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e15abe44b0e95afa45dd19faa53ac41e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23fed92ffe59e67730588150c2a1cbf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a12e811ea06c5bd6638d7a05b6486e7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0cf7746378c6e8d2b371fa8b0e35955&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b22c7f65c401c0b783c864349640f372&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a60d6af54cb19714a27e9fba5484f00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f820b4fd30fc97f0083ef9327fa9ac7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7029b183fa2cc4e652b9cb3d96c587ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-613368bdb7745a7ad903ee709c39868e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4cb059595fad783966d73f011af493a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789d4663e2e3eeb5466a2592bc8824b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b320d4bf5bae3f28f4bca97246cd735&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5264961d05f0c