    <node id="&quot;AMERICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">America is a country and continent discussed in the context of its agricultural policies, land use, and the transition from a family-farm agrarian economy to an industrial one. It is the setting for the text's discussions on food systems, honey bee threats, and social and economic stratification.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d68449f9db8a1088d8cfd218d490323d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9b2fa060b49dfcd9523440966c974ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c46a7f814f9b988da76a9ac71bdab30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8609577658e45ab0e2c17bf451f3b33b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5399890419cd7e402f5e411514ee3c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db735f250cad30d060b6ea644151e172&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c08392ee1c44f7a4ba02412343bf13d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5ec62399679b6e30a34af778780d6d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b87537885c268eea02e5c3eda3297f5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08a903bcc29ba54a545f0fbfc922a7b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97df03a76764ebe5533b42a54e7596c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f41a230435631a03248889184c93b965&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c6f8753099a6779fea902d00492c19f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c2431b3b4552aa63a72178a202c92bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41976a69de893e06188aa8717a3c4235&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ce3ac9eff641a1aef95c387b1c50fb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-240dc87c75a401ddeacc3f1a641ed3ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-412bb4d9e4870a3cb542b0d1793d0568&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec40b39eb28db43874a476893ae69b4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-010d59f53c353a09e626f3656e43f25f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ffdb0c84602631ea1239c5c98fe486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d488e4cd2bbc4b091273904e594e2cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b547b6cef0753ad76c2ec6637caea67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42d3a39282037fb0810e4ffb4ed03f81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4953d5aa366add6d40468e1643931eaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5f192ebac2944968cd0ca9275cc34d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3e7055c35d73ed38d71048f4698efe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d86135a3ecce951cb211b81554dd41c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2f3cf7878919c86769d45741d13fa4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff7ff846be03f8677673730625ad6e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1c7e1b601a6b8a0deb46da88c1a33b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58df44cda05927cd903adbe63f48641c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ba9b55dcb2de76a73fed895734246f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbf26e9a63fe788b2d8ce72fc174f104&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15a140060d3e3d6e8b8621035f57c83f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd762b4d6c9647db05924d3e745a6991&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9da95d303f996398774af59a2327d539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a222f4d2ebac0805d7a35f6ea2281563&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cee44e954d1abb009f061fd993b844c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b04d5012cc1525877c7e032e6701e281&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4642364014d20