    <node id="&quot;USDA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">The USDA is the United States Department of Agriculture, a federal agency responsible for agricultural research, data collection, and programs. It oversees food safety, organic standards, and grading and packaging requirements for agricultural products.</data>
